{"version":1,"text":"# Cedar cold-room retrofit: approved acceptance rule C-21\nDocument status: approved. Scope: Cedar cold-room retrofit, controlled trial C-21 only.\nAll organizations, equipment, people, dates, and measurements in this document are invented for a synthetic local evaluation. This is not a public source or production record.\nA candidate passes C-21 only if BOTH conditions hold: (1) electrical energy reduction relative to the baseline is at least 12.5 percent; (2) the maximum interior temperature is at most 5.0 degrees Celsius. Use (baseline energy minus candidate energy) divided by baseline energy, times 100. Both inequalities include equality. Do not replace the maximum temperature with the average temperature.\nC-21 establishes trial acceptance only. It does not establish total operating cost or authorize deployment at other locations.\n","id":"cedar-1","title":"01-approved-acceptance.md","source":"synthetic:cedar/01-approved-acceptance.md","revision":1,"workspace_id":"b3100607-2711-432a-92e5-675ec2c3c317"}